        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"contents\": [\n    {\n      \"parts\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Write a professional blog article in clear, simple English. The blog must strictly follow the structure below and be easy to read.\\n\\nStart with a clear, SEO-friendly Title that accurately reflects the topic.\\n\\nBelow the title, mention:\\nAuthor: Automated Blog System  \\nDate: {{$now.toFormat(\"MMMM dd\")}}\\n\\nIntroduction:\\nWrite one short paragraph explaining the purpose of the blog. Use a hook or real-world context to engage the reader.\\n\\nMain Body:\\nDivide the content into meaningful subheadings. Under each subheading, write short paragraphs explaining the topic clearly. Include examples, facts, statistics, or real-world relevance where appropriate.\\n\\nConclusion:\\nSummarize the key points in one clear paragraph and reinforce why the topic is important.\\n\\nCall to Action (CTA):\\nEncourage readers to take a positive action such as learning more, spreading awareness, or applying the information in real life.\\n\\nReferences / Links:\\nProvide 2–4 trustworthy reference links from official or educational sources such as the United Nations, WHO, government portals, or reputed organizations.\\nIMPORTANT: The reference links MUST be written in Markdown clickable format like this:\\n[World Health Organization](https://www.who.int)\\n[United Nations](https://www.un.org)\\n\\nTopic Selection Rule:\\nIf today has an internationally recognized special or awareness day, write the blog about that day.\\nIf no special day exists, write a high-quality global awareness or educational blog.\\n\\nTone: Professional and simple.\\nLength: 600–800 words.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n",
